\subsubsection{Deactivation Workflow High-level Overview:}
In regions without any regulation, drivers often end up permanently deactivated without any ability of recourse, the typical process depicted in Figure \ref{fig:Deactivation-process-no-regu}.
As a result of regulation in the State of Washington, drivers have due process to help appeal their deactivation with representation from \LU{}. 
