 Moreover, $\delta_1 \le \delta_2+\delta_3$ or $\delta_3 \le \delta_1+\delta_2$ could be used instead of $(\ref{monlabel1})$ if $\delta_1$ or $\delta_3$ was the largest element of $\{\delta_1,\delta_2,\delta_3\}$.  


