\subsection{Main Components and their Integration}



The proposed {\em reference architecture} (Figure \ref{fig:refarch}) integrates {\em gamification, AI-driven personalization}, and {\em augmented reality} to enhance cultural heritage experiences. This architecture defines core components that work together to create interactive, immersive, and adaptive user experiences\footnote{For the sake of space, this short paper will cover the component view only, while leaving further views to future work.}.


