\sloppy The {\em Gamification Engine} (Figure \ref{fig:refarch}.b) plays a central role in driving engagement by managing game logic, tracking progress, and executing challenges. It integrates elements such as points, badges, levels, and leaderboards, ensuring that users remain motivated throughout their exploration. The engine processes \texttt{game actions} triggered by user interactions, evaluating them against predefined rules and updating the \texttt{game status} in real time (Figure \ref{fig:MobileApp}.b). A {\em Domain-Specific Language (DSL)} \cite{BucchiaroneMFM23} facilitates the creation of \texttt{gamification rules}, enabling structured and adaptable game mechanics. 
