\subsection{Cross-Model Generalizability and Adaptive Logic Impact}

To validate SymRAG's generalizability and the critical importance of adaptive logic, we conducted comprehensive ablation studies across both LLM architectures. Table~\ref{tab:cross_model_ablation} presents the dramatic impact of disabling adaptive logic, establishing universal efficiency criticality despite model-specific variations (see Appendix~\ref{app:ablation_studies} for a visual representation).

