Moreover, it is easy to see that the order of each cycle in $\C$ is divisible by 3, and the algorithm takes $O(n^3)$ time, dominated by computing the minimum weight cycle packing $\C_{X_\varepsilon}$~\cite{hartvigsen1984extensions}.

