This establishes the desired inequality.
	\end{proof}


	\subsubsection{A Mean Increment}
	\label{sec_mean_Gamma_app}

	We now analyze the mean increment \(h^{(\Gamma)}(\bm\phi_n, \Gamma_n; \bm\theta_n, \gamma_n)\) in the updating rule \eqref{eq_Gamma_update_app}. %Noting that the process \(\int_0^{\cdot} Z_n^{(2,j)}(t) \dd W_n
