Taking integration and expectation in \eqref{eq_dz2_app}:
	\begin{equation}
		\begin{aligned}
			\label{eq_h2_app}
			&h^{(\Gamma)}(\Gamma_n; \bm\theta_n, \gamma_n) 
			= \frac{1}{2}\int_0^Tk_1(t; \bm\theta_n) \dd t \Gamma_n \Bigg(\sum_j D_j D_j^\top \Bigg) \Gamma_n - \frac{\gamma_n T}{2}\Gamma_n.
