According to \eqref{example:feasible:parameter:0}--\eqref{example:feasible:parameter:1} and Lemma \ref{g-cauchy matrix}, it is not difficult to verify that the constructed PIR coding framework satisfies the conditions $\widetilde{\mathrm{F}}$0 and $\widetilde{\mathrm{F}}$1. 


